{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_xingzh_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_xingzh_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "回家",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_xingzh_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a8cc0a31953a215c6ac39def68a3079d92fb0590e6845f3195225682f995b3be",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三只瞎鼷兽♪跑西又跑东♪\n一只掉进沟♪一只摔破头♪\n还有一只嘿♪叮个里咚咚♪\n这我可得记下来。维多利亚的儿歌真有意思，你小时候，你......我们的母亲就唱着这些头破血流的段子哄你睡觉？\n更好玩的我还没唱呢，只不过这首特别应景。你知道这三只瞎鼷兽撞来撞去、跑东跑西，是在找什么吗？\n嗯......原来如此。它们也在找妈妈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>维多利亚，戴威尔镇</><p=2>1103年3月22日    6:00 P.M. 晴</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你脚趾头上的泡没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，以前没走过那么多路。磨出茧也就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这一路过来，还真像一只瞎眼的小鼷兽，慌慌张张、磕磕碰碰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是第一次离开炎国，还几乎横跨了半个泰拉，已经很了不起了。以后多来几次也就熟练了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎么反而愁眉苦脸的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是愁眉苦脸。只是......几天前还觉得很遥远，想不到明天就要和母亲见上面了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对了，你不是最喜欢街边小吃吗？我带你去尝尝我小时候的美味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗨呀，你看，一说好吃的你的眉头就松开了，馋鬼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我分明是舍肚皮陪君子。离开这里那么多年，光记得这里的好吃的，你才是那个馋鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那当然，我从这里搬走的时候都七八岁了。小时候跟着家里搬来搬去，每个镇上的美食我都记得，哈哈！到时候带你挨个吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这一回自己搬了家，才知道那时的你们多不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，说着说着眉头又拧起来了。快，去吃前面那家水果馅老奶油蛋糕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小时候每天放学都经过的店。不过，好吃是好吃，就是分量小了点。以前每天省一便士，省两个月买一块，一口就没了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那今天可得敞开肚子吃个够，我请你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么了？没找着钱包？哎呀，不会是宁小姐不想请客吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（神色慌张地翻找）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你先别着急，身上的口袋都找过了？内口袋里那鼓鼓囊囊的不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是我的手帕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你仔细回想一下，买完长途车票后放哪儿了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "口袋？不对......我不会把钱包留在购票台上了吧？我......一点都记不清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里也没有，刚才走过的地方都找了一遍，钱包真的丢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没事，等到了家，我写信去车站问问，说不定就留在了购票台上，等咱俩回程的时候就能拿到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么没事，那里面还有我们明天的车票。没有车票，我们怎么去你家？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在着急也没用，总不能再走个一天一夜回车站找钱包。放宽心，没把自己丢了就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......话里有话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "嘿嘿，没有。就是有的人最近迷迷糊糊，早上用我的洗面奶刷牙，午饭刀叉一正一反拿......\n哎有人捂嘴不让说，我还能说十条呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在哪里是开玩笑的时候！......我早说过钱不要都放我这儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你平时比我细心啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦......你也不用急成这样。钱包丢了也没什么大不了的，这里距离我老家也就几小时的车程，咱俩走都走回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要走回去？这么狼狈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（恍然大悟的表情）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不是！我只是担心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "突然感觉肚子饿了。炎国话说得好，人是铁，饭是钢，先吃饭，问题总能解决的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "钱包都没了，还要怎么解决......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也不是每个维多利亚人都有钱的，但也没几个人饿死，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看看现在是......太好了，这个时间应该还有饭。快走，再晚可就没了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走？走去哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "去给你变出一顿大餐——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你走慢点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "贝利家还开着，赶上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你先排着队，我去看看还剩多少，轮不轮得到我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小声）餐厅？煌......我们哪有钱买吃的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先不告诉你，等轮到你就知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸惴惴地随着队伍前进，却闻到一股异味，才注意到排在前面的是一位拾荒老者。再往前张望，队伍里的人看起来都各有难处。\n随着队伍行进，行箸看清桌上摞着几十个餐盒。前面的人领取后，没有付钱便默不作声地离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（维多利亚语）两份，多谢。祝你一天好心情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（原来是领救济餐。她这么熟门熟路......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说好有饭，没骗你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别的地方我还吃不准，戴威尔镇可是我生活过的地方，没钱算什么，解决方法多的是，不许急了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（轻声叹气）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看领到了点什么——羽兽腿排、黑麦面包......瘤奶酪，竹篮打水套餐还是这老三样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尝尝，看看你喜欢的和我一不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看到煌大快朵颐、大加怀念的模样，行箸不免产生了一丝好奇，低头将三样食物各尝了一口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么样？哪个最好吃？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都......都不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是吧！尤其是腿排，这上面的肉冻入口即化，特别鲜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（这应该是小火烤熟的腿排，热的时候流淌着肉汁。卖剩的早已放凉，所以肉汁都成了肉冻......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "炎国勾吴有道名菜，叫水晶肴肉，喜欢肉冻的话，下次来炎国我请你吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（一边大口咀嚼一边摇头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（含糊不清）不一样......吃上腿排肉冻是要运气的，所以还有惊喜的成分在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "靠运气才能吃上？也就是说，也有走空的时候了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不会，那个时候每个餐厅的发餐时间我都背得滚瓜烂熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但这家店离我们的住处很远，得等老爸老妈同时加班，别家的餐都发完了的情况下，我们才会绕远路来这儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "饭吃不上几口，等走回去的时候差不多又该饿了，所以，老爸给它起名叫竹篮打水套餐，吃了也白吃，哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "父亲原来是这样爱开玩笑的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "面包硬得咬不动，奶酪干得开裂，显然已经在橱窗放了几天，量也少得可怜。\n即便一路追问父母的经历，一直存在于想象中的画面却直到这些食物入口时才变得清晰。\n行箸愧疚地望向手里的食物，忽地大口咀嚼起来，一会儿便将一盒救济餐吃了个干净。\n她沿着父母走过的路行走着，睁大了眼睛，恨不得望穿时间，将他们曾行走在此间的鲜活模样映入眼底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真怀念啊，以前就是走这条路回家的。前面是我的第一所小学，印象最深的是有个同学，他妈妈每天在校门口卖水果馅饼干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就天天跑去摊子前和那同学说话，顺便拼命张大鼻孔，就为了吸走一点饼干香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那时候老妈在染布工厂工作，每天带着一股刺鼻的气味回家。我就提议她也去卖饼干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这点小心思，一眼就被看穿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，但她不像别人爸妈那样，把小孩的话当耳边风。她第二天就带我去和那位卖饼干的大婶聊天，打听她每周能卖多少饼干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "回家后我们一起算了笔账，我发现比起卖饼干，做工人每周能稳定地多赚五镑，那可是好多饼干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老妈厉害吧，她说服人从来不像老爸那样啰里啰嗦讲道理的——但那年生日，我收到了一整包饼干。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸想象着饼干摊前那样干练又温柔的母亲，不禁露出微笑。她被脑中想象的画面吸引着，不由得越走越远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行箸......要不，我们先找个地方休息吧？再走下去，肚子里的晚饭可真就成竹篮打水了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想......再走走，看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等到了我家，再坐车出来看也不迟，反正就在邻镇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我现在就想......多看多了解一点，否则明天见到了母亲......和她聊什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "随便聊啊。你是老妈的亲生女儿，你见她天经地义，又不需要考试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你从小在她身边长大，当然不一样了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不一样的，你们共同经历了这么多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸止住了话头，怔怔望着马路对面一家旧书店。心中一动，便朝那里走了过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎，你去哪里？走慢点，小心车！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "旧友......书店？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（在书架间缓缓走动）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行箸，老爸跟你说起过这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么会......我和他说过的话屈指可数。你为什么这么问？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那可真奇怪了......\n不对，应该说，那可真奇妙了。你等等我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "究竟什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "煌不回答，兴冲冲地跑到书店柜台前，与老板说了一通话，看起来似乎她竟然与这里有一些渊源。\n然而，与老板的对话结束后，她的面色变得沮丧，转向行箸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，这家书店的老老板已经去世了。老爸以前......在他的手下工作过。老爸以前是这里的理货员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你说......这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，所以你刚才这么笔直地走过来，我才以为你知道这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是......想来这里看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看，你还担心什么啊。你们到底是父女，他要是还活着，你们一定有聊不够的天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老妈更是性格开朗，你和她之间，一定更聊得来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸朝她笑笑，但并没有被这话安慰到。她将脸朝着书架，不叫煌看见。走着走着，目光被一排书吸引。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这里有炎国书？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对啊！你以为老爸为什么辞了染布工厂的工作跑到这里来打工，为了这事老妈还跟他不高兴呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为了看书？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯。他这人可爱看书了，发现了这里有炎国书后，就天天来接我放学。我一看他换了身干净衣服，就知道他要带我来书店。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我心里乐意，他站在这儿一看书就是半小时，就没人打扰我看连环画了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老老板竟也不气恼，看来也是个大好人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那又没办法，别的客人都能看，总不见得单他不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有一天，老爸却没看书，而是直接拿着书去柜台了。支支吾吾，好像突然不会维多利亚语了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我听了半天，才知道，他堆了一堆客气词，是想请老老板把书折价卖给他。理由是——书是旧的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可这里的炎国书压根没人看，那就是他自己天天来翻，把书给看旧的呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "噗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可能外国书在这里确实不太好卖吧，总之老老板最后答应了。结果，等我们离了店，老爸反过来教育我，叫我万万不可学他那样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀，他是故意的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我问学他哪样？他一下就面红耳赤，君子来君子去的说一通，早不记得了。总之，他好像对这件事十分愧疚，后来，就来这里打工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可这样一来，他不就能光明正大地看这里的书了？何况，花钱买书的事还要瞒着母亲。所以我看老爸在这件事上，始终不是君子，哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸如痴如醉地听着陈年旧事，怔怔地望着那排书架。\n她仿佛望见父亲在自己身边，珍惜地翻看着这里为数不多的炎国书，而自己跟在他的身边，一个一个认书上的文字。\n一会儿，这里又好似是家里的书桌，书上的字变成了父亲的一手好字。\n然而，当眼前幻影散去，她看清手中捧着的那本，不过是陌生的书名，齐整的印刷字罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "煌！我......我想买本书给母亲......我看，这本咏月的诗集正好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，也许......可是，为什么突然想买书？见面礼你不是已经准备好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就是有种感觉，如果母亲和我的感觉一样，也许，她也会想收到一本......从这里买的炎国书。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸说着，无措地在自己身上上下寻找一番，最后毫不犹豫地脱下腕上的玉镯，就往柜台走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊等等等等，你这镯子，能买下一整个店的书吧？！要不，用我的......呃，折叠刀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你不用把书抓这么紧，书封都快破啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真的没关系，煌。这个镯子......是不知哪个大臣送我的生日礼物。现在爷爷落魄了，那人一定恨不得这镯子能自己碎掉消失掉才好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你过来帮我翻译，好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>维多利亚，戴威尔镇郊外</><p=2>1103年3月23日    12:16 A.M. 晴</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看起来这里是附近最适合露宿的地方了。这块草地比较干燥，你垫着我的衣服在这儿睡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我睡草地上。别担心，比起出任务的时候睡过的某些地方，这里干净舒服得多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不行，现在可不是出任务。我的衣服也垫着，我俩一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行，明天还要走一天，早点睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......什么东西丢了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "吵到你了？我轻些。没丢东西，我把明天带给母亲的见面礼先收拾出来，再把刚才买到的书包装一下就睡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明天理也来得及啊......好吧，你别累着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......弄脏什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呀，你还没睡着？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......我担心身上有味道，头发里也都是灰尘，就简单洗漱一下。就是水凉得很......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不住吹冻僵的手）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实......明天到家里还能洗热水澡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我很快就好，你先睡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你......再不睡明天走不动路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好好好，这就来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "躺下了，你也睡吧，别替我操心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚刚在看什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别瞪我......好吧，是你问母亲要来的那本，她在学宫时参写的文学论述。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你真把见面当考试啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是......只是左右睡不着，睹文如见人，指望靠这样静下心来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我......实在......\n哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸捂住肋骨，那里刚刚被煌快如闪电地戳了一下。她自小未有机会与同龄姐妹这样玩闹，一时愣在当场，不知煌要做什么。\n只见煌闭着眼睛大声打鼾，嘴角却有笑意，甚是可恶。行箸明白过来，“恶向胆边生”，也朝煌的肋骨戳去。\n但她手又慢，戳得又不准，装睡的煌一翻身就躲过了，瞬时反手又戳中行箸，痒得她乱躲。\n行箸气得伸手朝煌扑去，两边门户大开，煌突然跳起来便呵她的痒，惊得她滚倒在地。两人又笑又闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀！停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快停下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你头怎么了？磕石头上了？我看看......哎哟，额头磕破皮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘶......都叫你停下了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......简直是......笨手笨脚，没心没肺，不可理喻，荒谬至极！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我错了我错了，也不用发这么大火吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明天叫母亲看见了，像什么样子......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你别急，只破了一点点，不算破相的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对不起啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那......我去睡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（叹气）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "头还痛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（叹气）我知道你想逗我开心。对不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么是你对不起？是我管不住手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "刚瞧着你，脑袋里突然想到，小时候要是有个这样的老妹，我肯定天天欺负她玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我倒逃过一劫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实我这两天，心里乱得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看出来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你总想让我放轻松，看开点。你要去见的，是你最亲的亲人，可她对我来说，究竟算什么人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "世上唯一与我还有血缘的亲人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小时候日思夜想却见不着的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是从未有过交集的陌生人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老妈她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我好不容易想讲，你听我讲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不要以为我有什么妄想，我从没指望她生下了我就必须要如何待我。可我心底里，还是期望今后能有这么一位亲亲热热的亲人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以为，只要多了解她的过往，总能拉近距离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可等我真的来到了维多利亚，却发现我这也不知道，那也没见过。我根本，根本是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "对你们的过往一无所知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......害怕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我怕我们早就走不近了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许刚见面的时候还会感动，但是会不会等激动的心情过去，发现我们到底只是两个不太熟的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "会不会到最后，我还是寥寥一人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我一想到这些，就感到凄凉无比......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（叹气）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我知道，你又要说我想得太多，我也觉得自己想得太多......还忍不住朝你发脾气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道吗，小时候我便是这样的性子，一有什么事紧张烦恼，就上火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "读书时是考试前特别烦躁，等长大了，就是自己编的书上交时心中不安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我那时的处境，心中有火却不方便发，全都咽进了肚里。不知为何，现在到了这里，却无端地朝你嚷嚷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "寄人篱下发火本不应该，向自己亲近之人发脾气又可以了？明明越亲近，越不应该的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......向你道歉，好不好？你别放心上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "煌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（均匀的呼吸声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "睡着了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>维多利亚，蓝铃镇</><p=2>1103年3月23日    5:50 P.M.</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要，都坚持一整天了，最后一段路我可以自己走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别客气，你看起来还没我的链锯重呢，我能扛着链锯跑三小时不带喘的。来来来，直接坐我肩上——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别闹。到底还有多少路？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快了快了，最多还有一......一......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一个小时？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是不是，炎国话怎么说的来着......一盏茶的时间~看，沿着这条路走到头就是了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸停下了脚步，怔怔望着路的尽头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这就要到了......等等，我的梳子不见了......快把你的借我用用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不用梳子，用手指。你要的话，我家里肯定有梳子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都到你家了怎么还来得及......不行，我的头发乱七八糟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的头发很整齐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那......那再等等，我检查一下见面礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀......书明明压在最底下，怎么还是折角了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行箸，走吧。走了那么远那么难的路，终于要走到了。总不能在家门口退缩吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......你先别往前走！你家规矩是什么，我，一会儿进门要换鞋吗？衣服挂在哪里？我......应该喊她阿姨还是妈妈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哎呀！你不要拽我，我自己走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁见自己妈还要又送礼又怕坏了规矩，都是自己人，你哪只脚先踩进门，鞋子朝左还是朝右放有那么重要吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......突然嚷嚷什么？！那当然重要了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "多重要？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然就是......是我现在人生中最重要的事啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，我还以为你搞不清楚呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什么意思？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你给我仔细想想，要见到自己的亲妈，你到底是什么感觉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我害怕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你再说一遍？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我当然是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "高兴得不得了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "日日盼夜夜盼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我这一生，难得那么如意，又怕自己盼得太多，难免失望，才拼命去想一些糟心事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你心里是高兴的，对吧。那走吧，什么熟不起来的陌生人，失去了四十年，难道以后不能补回来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你昨天居然醒着？你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "说得对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸倒抽一口冷气，在一扇木门前刹住脚步。那木门看起来普普通通，门头挂着一盏灯，灯里有一颗跳动的火焰，似是在等归来人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "行箸",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小声）你骗人，不是说还有一盏茶的工夫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿。维多利亚的茶杯比较小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行箸朝煌惴惴望了一眼，迟迟疑疑抬手又放下。还没来得及后退，后背就被煌重重推了一下，整个人撞入屋中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "妈！我们回来啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
